<title>THAILAND: Advanced Info floats 10-year debentures.</title>
<headline>Advanced Info floats 10-year debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai mobile phone operator Advanced Info Services Plc on Friday announced a plan to float up to four billion baht in unsecured debentures on foreign and domestic markets.</p>
<p>Advanced Info told the Stock Exchange of Thailand the 10-year issue superceded its earlier plan to offer 2.5 billion baht of the same instrument exclusively to foreign investors.</p>
<p>The company said details of the issue, to be denominated in baht and other currencies, would be decided after its expected approval by shareholders at a meeting scheduled for February 13.</p>
</text>
